From: HiDeck maintainers
Subject: Use the bundled GoogleTest headers for libzip's friend declaration

zip_writer.h includes gtest_prod.h even in production builds. BoringSSL's
vendored GoogleTest already supplies this header; no test runtime is linked.

--- a/vendor/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/vendor/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -118,1 +118,2 @@
-include_directories(${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR})
+include_directories(${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR})
+include_directories(${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/boringssl/third_party/googletest/googletest/include)
